/E (The most effective way to achieve AI-resilience is to shift from asynchronous to synchronous assessment, eliminating access to AI during task performance. Supervised exams, oral exams, in-class writing workshops, live presentations, or classroom discussions are structurally resistant to AI interference. These synchronous formats reduce the possibility of inappropriate AI use not by monitoring, but by designing out the opportunity.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
